<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-THIRD STAGE RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF MURCIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-THIRD STAGE RESULTS IN THE TOUR OF MURCIA.</headline>
<dateline>CIEZA, Spain 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the 202-km third</p>
